      "end_line": 96,
      "category": "bug",
      "severity": "medium"
    },
    {
      "path": "src/ui/screens/NowBox.tsx",
      "content": "Keeping each label inside the track does not keep the two labels apart. The shared meter explicitly supports both rails at zero, where both labels receive left: 0% and render on top of each other; closely spaced same-sign rails likewise overlap. The fixed-height, nowrap label row has no collision handling. Measure/reserve label space or move colliding labels onto separate rows, and extend the layout test beyond the ordinary opposite-sign stock rails.",
      "existing_code": "      \u003cspan className=\"now-label\" data-line={line} data-tone={line === 'stop' ? 'loss' : 'profit'} style={{ left: place, transform: `translateX(-${place})` }}\u003e",
